OL,3,AGovernment investigating 'serious cyber
OL,4,Aincident' hitting pension and benefits
OL,5,Aservices, minister says
OL,6,
OL,7,FRegular benefit and pension payments
OL,8,Fare not affected and will be paid as
OL,9,Fnormal, the department says
OL,11,FGemma, 34, says she has just #30 left
OL,12,Fin her bank account and worries her
OL,13,Fpayments could be cut if she fails to
OL,14,Ffill out her universal credit journal -
OL,15,Fbut DWP confirms people in situations
OL,16,Flike hers will not be sanctioned
OL,18,FOur correspondent says cyber incident
OL,19,Fhas become a catch-all term used in the
OL,20,Fearly stages of what often ends up
OL,21,Fbeing a cyber attack - here's the
OL,22,Fdifference
