OL,3,AMarching bands scramble to cover costs
OL,4,Aafter Thanksgiving parade rearranged
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of student musicians from
OL,7,FHawaii, meanwhile, voiced their relief
OL,8,Fafter friends and family rallied around
OL,9,Fto cover their additional hotel, coach
OL,10,Fand meal costs.
OL,12,FThe parade, a famous annual event, is
OL,13,Fnow scheduled to take place on
OL,14,FSaturday.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
