OL,3,ALeaders clash in final Spain election
OL,4,Adebate as housing dominates run-in
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpain's main party leaders have made
OL,7,Ftheir last pitch to voters in a
OL,8,Ffractious final TV debate that focused
OL,9,Fheavily on the country's housing
OL,10,Fcrisis.
OL,12,FSpaniards go to the ballot box on
OL,13,FSunday, with opinion polls suggesting
OL,14,FSocialist Prime Minister Pedro Sanchez
OL,15,Fwill fail to extend his eight years in
OL,16,Foffice.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
