OL,3,ALeaders clash in final Spain election
OL,4,Adebate as housing dominates run-in
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe debate on Thursday night marked the
OL,7,Fculmination of a campaign, which has
OL,8,Fbeen defined by the din of house keys
OL,9,Fbeing jangled in symbolic protest,
OL,10,Frather than any carefully crafted words
OL,11,Fof politicians.
OL,13,FThe struggle many face in opening the
OL,14,Fdoor to an affordable home has led to
OL,15,Fdemonstrations filling plazas across
OL,16,Fthe country.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
